title: Sign-in relayed through a web-proxy kit
severity: critical
score: 75
tags: phishing, aitm, proxy
attack: T1557, T1566.002, T1539
description: A non-allowlisted page runs an interception web proxy (Ultraviolet, Scramjet,
  Rammerhead) and presents a sign-in: a fake browser window, a credential prompt or a
  Microsoft sign-in page. The victim sees the brand's real login, served through the
  attacker's host, which keeps the session (AiTM).
---
capture
// An interception web proxy (Ultraviolet, Scramjet, Rammerhead) loaded from a host that
// is not allowlisted ...
| where signal("network.web_proxy_kit_count") > 0
// ... presenting a sign-in: a fake browser window, a fake address bar, a Microsoft
// sign-in clone or a brand credential prompt.
| where exists(fake_window_frames)
    or exists(fake_address_bars)
    or exists(ms_clone_pages)
    or signal("brand.credential_prompt") == true
| project kits = signal("network.web_proxy_kits"), assets = signal("network.web_proxy_assets"),
          brand = signal("brand.name"), final_url = signal("final.url")
